    "article_summary": "The article describes a Ni/photoredox-catalyzed C(sp3)-C(sp3) cross-coupling between aziridines and benzaldehyde dialkyl acetals. The methodology enables the synthesis of various beta-substituted sulfonamides, including methyl, primary, and secondary alkyl groups. Mechanistic studies, including LFER and stoichiometric experiments, suggest that aziridine activation proceeds via a previously unexplored Ni(I) oxidative addition rather than the conventional Ni(0) pathway.",
